{"seq":3,"slug":"semiconductor-materials","title":"半导体材料化学（Semiconductor Materials Chemistry）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/inorganic-materials/semiconductor-materials","wordCount":2918,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"半导体材料化学-semiconductor-materials-chemistry\">半导体材料化学（Semiconductor Materials Chemistry）</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>半导体材料是现代信息社会的物质根基。从处理器芯片中的硅单晶，到LED照明中的GaN，再到太阳能电池中的钙钛矿，半导体材料的化学设计和制备工艺直接决定了电子器件的性能极限。半导体材料化学关注的核心问题是：如何通过化学组成、晶体结构和缺陷控制来精确调控材料的电子结构（带隙、载流子浓度和迁移率）。</p>\n<p>本文从半导体物理基础出发，系统介绍元素半导体、化合物半导体和新型半导体材料的化学本质、制备方法和应用前沿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>半导体材料化学的核心命题是：<strong>通过化学组成、晶体结构和缺陷控制，精确调控材料的电子结构（带隙 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、载流子浓度与迁移率）</strong>。围绕这一命题有三个层层递进的概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>带隙 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（决定「能不能用」）</strong>：价带顶与导带底之间的能量差，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 &lt; E_g &lt; 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> eV 为半导体。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通过化学组成调控，直接决定器件的工作波段（Si 1.1 eV 用于逻辑、GaN 3.4 eV 用于蓝光、SiC 3.26 eV 用于功率）。</li>\n<li><strong>直接/间接带隙（决定「用来做什么」）</strong>：直接带隙材料（GaAs、GaN、InP）光学跃迁高效，适合发光；间接带隙材料（Si、Ge）需声子辅助、发光效率低，却因载流子寿命长而适合光伏。</li>\n<li><strong>掺杂（决定「性能多好」）</strong>：通过施主（V 族）或受主（III 族）杂质控制载流子类型与浓度，浓度可在 6 个数量级以上调控；pn 结由此成为几乎所有半导体器件的基础。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>贯穿全篇的判据是 <strong>「组成 → <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> → 器件功能」链</strong>：所有新型半导体（2D 材料、有机半导体、钙钛矿）的探索，本质都在寻找这条链上「硅无法覆盖」的区段。常见误解是把「带隙越大越好」当成定律——大带隙带来高击穿电场却牺牲载流子迁移率与光学吸收，因此宽禁带半导体专攻功率器件而非逻辑，选择取决于应用而非绝对优劣。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S[半导体材料] --&gt; P[电子结构调控]&#10;  P --&gt; E1[带隙 Eg&lt;br/&gt;组成决定工作波段]&#10;  P --&gt; E2[直接/间接带隙&lt;br/&gt;决定发光或光伏]&#10;  P --&gt; E3[掺杂&lt;br/&gt;施主/受主 载流子浓度]&#10;  S --&gt; G1[元素半导体 Si]&#10;  S --&gt; G2[III-V 化合物 GaAs/GaN/InP]&#10;  S --&gt; G3[宽带隙 SiC/Ga2O3/金刚石]&#10;  S --&gt; G4[新型 2D/有机/钙钛矿]&#10;  G3 --&gt; A1[功率电子]&#10;  G2 --&gt; A2[光电子/高频]&#10;  G4 --&gt; A3[后硅时代多元化]\">flowchart TD\n  S[半导体材料] --&gt; P[电子结构调控]\n  P --&gt; E1[带隙 Eg&lt;br/&gt;组成决定工作波段]\n  P --&gt; E2[直接/间接带隙&lt;br/&gt;决定发光或光伏]\n  P --&gt; E3[掺杂&lt;br/&gt;施主/受主 载流子浓度]\n  S --&gt; G1[元素半导体 Si]\n  S --&gt; G2[III-V 化合物 GaAs/GaN/InP]\n  S --&gt; G3[宽带隙 SiC/Ga2O3/金刚石]\n  S --&gt; G4[新型 2D/有机/钙钛矿]\n  G3 --&gt; A1[功率电子]\n  G2 --&gt; A2[光电子/高频]\n  G4 --&gt; A3[后硅时代多元化]</pre><p>各类半导体材料的关键参数对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>材料</th>\n<th>带隙 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/eV</th>\n<th>迁移率/(cm²/V·s)</th>\n<th>关键优势</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Si</td>\n<td>1.12（间接）</td>\n<td>1450（e⁻）</td>\n<td>资源丰富、工艺成熟、纯度高</td>\n<td>逻辑芯片、光伏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GaAs</td>\n<td>1.42（直接）</td>\n<td>8500（e⁻）</td>\n<td>高频、高效发光</td>\n<td>5G 射频、单结电池</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GaN</td>\n<td>3.4（直接）</td>\n<td>高（2DEG）</td>\n<td>蓝光发光、高击穿电场</td>\n<td>LED、快充、逆变器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SiC（4H）</td>\n<td>3.26（间接）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高击穿电场、高热导率</td>\n<td>电动汽车功率器件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ga₂O₃</td>\n<td>4.9</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>可熔体法生长、BFOM 高</td>\n<td>kV 级功率器件（研发）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金刚石</td>\n<td>5.47</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>热导率最高、击穿电场最高</td>\n<td>散热衬底（n 型待突破）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MoS₂（单层）</td>\n<td>1.8（直接）</td>\n<td>~200</td>\n<td>原子级厚度、柔性</td>\n<td>后摩尔沟道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钙钛矿</td>\n<td>1.2-3.0 可调</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>缺陷容忍、吸光系数高</td>\n<td>光伏、叠层电池</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"半导体物理基础\">半导体物理基础</h2><h3 id=\"能带理论\">能带理论</h3><p>固体中大量原子的电子轨道重叠形成连续能带：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>价带（Valence Band, VB）</strong>：被电子填满的最高能带</li>\n<li><strong>导带（Conduction Band, CB）</strong>：价带之上的空带</li>\n<li><strong>禁带（Band Gap, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</strong>：价带顶到导带底的能量差</li>\n</ul>\n<p>根据<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>大小分类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>导体：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_g = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>（能带重叠或部分填充）</li>\n<li>半导体：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 &lt; E_g &lt; 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> eV</li>\n<li>绝缘体：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_g &gt; 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> eV</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>直接带隙 vs 间接带隙</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>直接带隙（GaAs, InP, GaN）：价带顶和导带底在k空间同一位置，光学跃迁高效→适合发光器件</li>\n<li>间接带隙（Si, Ge）：需要声子辅助跃迁，发光效率低→不适合LED但适合光伏（长载流子寿命）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"载流子与掺杂\">载流子与掺杂</h3><p><strong>本征半导体</strong>：纯净半导体中电子-空穴对由热激发产生： </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></mrow></msqrt><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i = \\sqrt{N_C N_V} \\exp(-E_g / 2k_BT)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2866em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0005em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9605em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2395em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Si @ 300K：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i = 1.5 \\times 10^{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> cm⁻³</p>\n<p><strong>n-type掺杂</strong>（V族掺入Si）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>P, As, Sb提供多余电子→施主能级（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>在<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>下方~45 meV）</li>\n<li>室温下完全电离：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\approx N_D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>实例：1 ppm P掺杂Si→<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>16</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n ≈ 5 \\times 10^{16}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">16</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> cm⁻³（提高6个数量级）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>p-type掺杂</strong>（III族掺入Si）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>B, Al, Ga接受电子→受主能级（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>在<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>上方~45 meV）</li>\n<li>产生空穴为多数载流子</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>载流子迁移率</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Si电子迁移率：1450 cm²/V·s @ 300K</li>\n<li>Si空穴迁移率：500 cm²/V·s</li>\n<li>GaAs电子迁移率：8500 cm²/V·s（高速器件）</li>\n<li>InSb电子迁移率：78,000 cm²/V·s（红外探测器）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"pn结\">pn结</h3><p>p-type和n-type半导体接触形成pn结，是几乎所有半导体器件的基础：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>内建电场指向n→p（空间电荷区/耗尽层）</li>\n<li>正偏（p接正极）：势垒降低→电流指数增长（二极管导通）</li>\n<li>反偏：势垒增高→仅有微小漏电流</li>\n<li>光伏效应：光生载流子被内建电场分离→光电流（太阳能电池原理）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"硅材料\">硅材料</h2><h3 id=\"多晶硅制备\">多晶硅制备</h3><p><strong>改良西门子法（Siemens Process）</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>冶金级硅（98%纯度）+ HCl → SiHCl₃（三氯氢硅）</li>\n<li>多次精馏提纯SiHCl₃（去除B、P等杂质）</li>\n<li>SiHCl₃ + H₂ → Si + 3HCl（CVD沉积在硅棒上，1100°C）</li>\n<li>产品纯度：电子级多晶硅9N-11N（99.9999999-99.999999999%）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>流化床法（FBR）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SiH₄在流化床中热分解沉积在小硅粒上</li>\n<li>能耗低于西门子法（~20 vs ~60 kWh/kg）</li>\n<li>产品为粒状硅（Granular Polysilicon），纯度略低于棒状硅</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"单晶生长\">单晶生长</h3><p><strong>Czochralski法（直拉法/CZ法）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>将籽晶浸入硅熔体（1414°C）缓慢提拉并旋转</li>\n<li>晶体直径通过拉速和温度控制（当前最大300 mm/12英寸晶圆）</li>\n<li>氧含量：~10¹⁸ cm⁻³（来自石英坩埚溶解）</li>\n<li>适用于：集成电路（&gt;95%市场份额）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Float Zone法（区熔法/FZ法）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>高频感应线圈局部熔化多晶硅棒并使熔区移动</li>\n<li>无坩埚→极低氧碳含量</li>\n<li>高电阻率（&gt;1000 Ω·cm），适用于功率器件</li>\n<li>缺点：晶体直径受限（最大200 mm）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"硅片加工\">硅片加工</h3><p>从单晶硅锭到可用晶圆需经过精密加工：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>切割（金刚线切割，线径&lt;50 μm→减少切割损失）</li>\n<li>研磨→减薄到目标厚度</li>\n<li>化学机械抛光（CMP）→表面粗糙度&lt;0.5 nm RMS</li>\n<li>清洗（RCA清洗：SC1去有机物，SC2去金属）</li>\n<li>外延（Epitaxy）：CVD在晶圆表面生长高纯度薄层</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"iii-v族化合物半导体\">III-V族化合物半导体</h2><h3 id=\"gaas材料\">GaAs材料</h3><p>GaAs是第二重要的半导体材料：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>带隙：1.42 eV（直接带隙）</li>\n<li>电子迁移率：8500 cm²/V·s（Si的6倍）</li>\n<li>高频器件：HEMT（高电子迁移率晶体管）用于5G射频前端</li>\n<li>太阳能电池：单结GaAs效率29.1%（最高效单结电池）</li>\n<li>制备：Bridgman法或VGF法生长单晶；MOCVD/MBE生长外延薄膜</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"gan材料\">GaN材料</h3><p>GaN（氮化镓）引领了固态照明和功率电子两大革命：</p>\n<p><strong>蓝光LED</strong>（2014年诺贝尔物理学奖）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>带隙3.4 eV（紫外）→InGaN量子阱调制发蓝光</li>\n<li>InGaN/GaN MQW（多量子阱）结构</li>\n<li>LED发光效率&gt;200 lm/W，寿命&gt;50,000小时</li>\n<li>挑战：&quot;效率骤降&quot;（Efficiency Droop）在高电流密度下</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>GaN功率器件</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>宽带隙→高击穿电场（3.3 MV/cm vs Si的0.3 MV/cm）</li>\n<li>低导通电阻+高开关频率</li>\n<li>GaN-on-Si HEMT：65W GaN充电器体积仅为Si方案的1/3</li>\n<li>应用：快充、服务器电源、电动汽车逆变器</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"inp材料\">InP材料</h3><p>InP在光通信领域占据核心地位：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>带隙：1.35 eV（直接），晶格匹配In₀.₅₃Ga₀.₄₇As（带隙0.74 eV→1.55 μm通信窗口）</li>\n<li>应用：激光器（DFB-LD）、光探测器（APD）、调制器</li>\n<li>太赫兹电子学：InP HEMT截止频率&gt;1 THz</li>\n<li>空间太阳能电池：InGaP/GaAs/InGaAs三结电池效率&gt;39%</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"mocvd外延技术\">MOCVD外延技术</h3><p>金属有机化学气相沉积（MOCVD/MOVPE）是III-V外延的主流方法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ga源：三甲基镓Ga(CH₃)₃（TMGa）</li>\n<li>As源：AsH₃（砷烷）或TBAs</li>\n<li>N源：NH₃</li>\n<li>反应：TMGa + NH₃ → GaN + 3CH₄（简化）</li>\n<li>精度：单原子层控制（&lt;0.3 nm/层）</li>\n<li>产能：单次可处理多片6英寸或8英寸晶圆</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"宽带隙半导体\">宽带隙半导体</h2><h3 id=\"sic材料\">SiC材料</h3><p>碳化硅功率半导体是电动汽车和新能源领域的核心：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>带隙：3.26 eV（4H-SiC）</li>\n<li>击穿电场：2.8 MV/cm（Si的10倍）</li>\n<li>热导率：370 W/m·K（散热优异）</li>\n<li>功率器件优势：开关损耗降低80%，系统效率提升5-10%</li>\n<li>电动汽车：Tesla Model 3首次规模采用SiC MOSFET逆变器</li>\n<li>晶体生长：物理气相输运法（PVT），6英寸和8英寸衬底已商用</li>\n<li>成本挑战：SiC衬底价格仍为Si的10倍以上</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"ga-o-材料\">Ga₂O₃材料</h3><p>β-Ga₂O₃是新兴超宽带隙半导体：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>带隙：4.9 eV（更高击穿电场）</li>\n<li>Baliga品质因子（BFOM）为SiC的4倍、Si的3000倍</li>\n<li>可用熔体法生长大尺寸单晶（成本潜力低于SiC）</li>\n<li>挑战：热导率低（11 W/m·K）、p-type掺杂困难</li>\n<li>研发阶段：2025年已有kV级Ga₂O₃ SBD/MOSFET原型器件</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"金刚石半导体\">金刚石半导体</h3><p>金刚石是&quot;终极半导体&quot;：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>带隙：5.47 eV</li>\n<li>热导率：2200 W/m·K（所有材料中最高）</li>\n<li>击穿电场：10 MV/cm</li>\n<li>理论BFOM为Si的50,000倍</li>\n<li>挑战：大面积单晶生长困难、n-type掺杂（P掺杂活化能高）</li>\n<li>CVD金刚石薄膜已用于散热衬底和窗口材料</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"新型半导体材料\">新型半导体材料</h2><h3 id=\"二维半导体\">二维半导体</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>MoS₂</strong>：直接带隙1.8 eV（单层），层状范德华材料，可剥离为原子级薄层</li>\n<li><strong>WSe₂</strong>：双极性输运，p-type FET迁移率~100 cm²/V·s</li>\n<li><strong>黑磷（BP）</strong>：可调带隙0.3-2 eV（层数依赖），高空穴迁移率~1000 cm²/V·s</li>\n<li>应用前景：柔性电子、光电探测、后摩尔时代晶体管沟道（亚1 nm厚度极限缩放）</li>\n<li>2D材料异质结：不受晶格匹配限制（范德华外延），设计自由度极大</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"有机半导体\">有机半导体</h3><p>有机半导体基于共轭π体系的分子轨道：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>小分子：并五苯（Pentacene）迁移率1-5 cm²/V·s</li>\n<li>聚合物：P3HT, PBTTT</li>\n<li>优势：溶液加工、柔性、大面积、低成本</li>\n<li>应用：OLED显示（已商业化）、有机太阳能电池（PCE&gt;19%）、可穿戴传感器</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"钙钛矿半导体\">钙钛矿半导体</h3><p>卤化物钙钛矿（ABX₃, 如CH₃NH₃PbI₃）在光伏和光电子领域异军突起：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>带隙可调：1.2-3.0 eV（通过Pb/Sn混合和I/Br/Cl卤素置换）</li>\n<li>优异光电性质：缺陷容忍性好、载流子扩散长度&gt;1 μm、高吸光系数</li>\n<li>光伏效率飞速攀升：2009年3.8% → 2025年26.95%（单结）→ 2026年27.87%</li>\n<li>钙钛矿/硅叠层电池：34.85%效率（隆基2025年NREL认证）</li>\n<li>稳定性挑战：水分/氧气/热/光引起降解，封装和组分工程是关键</li>\n<li>铅毒性问题：Sn基替代（效率较低）、Pb回收策略</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"关键总结\">关键总结</h2><ol>\n<li>半导体的核心物理量是带隙<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，通过化学组成精确调控<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>是器件设计的基础</li>\n<li>超纯硅的制备（9N-11N纯度）和大尺寸单晶生长是微电子产业的技术壁垒</li>\n<li>III-V族化合物（GaAs, GaN, InP）在光电子和高频电子中不可替代</li>\n<li>宽带隙半导体（SiC, GaN, Ga₂O₃）正在革新功率电子，SiC已大规模量产</li>\n<li>新型半导体（2D材料、有机半导体、钙钛矿）代表了&quot;后硅时代&quot;的多元化方向</li>\n</ol>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"半导体材料化学（Semiconductor Materials Chemistry）","id":"半导体材料化学-semiconductor-materials-chemistry"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"半导体物理基础","id":"半导体物理基础"},{"level":3,"text":"能带理论","id":"能带理论"},{"level":3,"text":"载流子与掺杂","id":"载流子与掺杂"},{"level":3,"text":"pn结","id":"pn结"},{"level":2,"text":"硅材料","id":"硅材料"},{"level":3,"text":"多晶硅制备","id":"多晶硅制备"},{"level":3,"text":"单晶生长","id":"单晶生长"},{"level":3,"text":"硅片加工","id":"硅片加工"},{"level":2,"text":"III-V族化合物半导体","id":"iii-v族化合物半导体"},{"level":3,"text":"GaAs材料","id":"gaas材料"},{"level":3,"text":"GaN材料","id":"gan材料"},{"level":3,"text":"InP材料","id":"inp材料"},{"level":3,"text":"MOCVD外延技术","id":"mocvd外延技术"},{"level":2,"text":"宽带隙半导体","id":"宽带隙半导体"},{"level":3,"text":"SiC材料","id":"sic材料"},{"level":3,"text":"Ga₂O₃材料","id":"ga-o-材料"},{"level":3,"text":"金刚石半导体","id":"金刚石半导体"},{"level":2,"text":"新型半导体材料","id":"新型半导体材料"},{"level":3,"text":"二维半导体","id":"二维半导体"},{"level":3,"text":"有机半导体","id":"有机半导体"},{"level":3,"text":"钙钛矿半导体","id":"钙钛矿半导体"},{"level":2,"text":"关键总结","id":"关键总结"}],"prev":{"title":"陶瓷与玻璃材料（Ceramics and Glasses）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/inorganic-materials/ceramics-glasses"},"next":{"title":"电池材料化学（Battery Materials Chemistry）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/energy-materials/battery-materials"}}